- 2022-10-16 program articulation: Xi’s report set the next five years around high-quality development, tech self-reliance, better public services, common prosperity, security, and greater international influence.
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"CPC expounds on main objectives, tasks for next 5 years","publisher":"english.www.gov.cn / Xinhua","publication_date":"2022-10-16","url":"https://english.www.gov.cn/news/topnews/202210/16/content_WS634ba3e5c6d0a757729e14cc.html","claim":"The CPC’s report to the 20th National Congress set out the main objectives and tasks for the next five years, including high-quality economic development, greater self-reliance in science and technology, more equitable public services, a better social security system, and stronger international influence.","locator":"lines 45-60","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Primary official publication with specific dated objectives and direct program language, though still self-authored regime material.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly within 2022 and explicitly framed as the next five-year program.","ruler_attribution":"Strong attribution: the report was presented by Xi Jinping on behalf of the CPC central leadership.","contrary_evidence":["The document states goals, not execution, so it does not by itself prove implementation success."],"lenses":["8B.1","8B.2","8B.10"]}
